[DOCUMENT]
TITLE: Harbor clinic
UID: APP-CLI
VERSION: 1.0.0
DATE: 2026-09-30
CLASSIFICATION: Internal
PREFIX: CLI-
ROOT: False

[GRAMMAR]
IMPORT_FROM_FILE: ../../grammar/org.sgra

[TEXT]
STATEMENT: Patient registration, chart access, prescribing, and results for the Harbor clinic portal. This is a fictional care setting.

[[SECTION]]
UID: CLI-SEC-REG
PREFIX: REG
TITLE: Registration

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: CLI-REG-001
TITLE: Match the patient
STATEMENT: Clinic shall match a registration to an existing patient before creating a second record.
STATUS: Active
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  ROLE: Refines
  VALUE: ENT-CLI-001
- TYPE: Parent
  ROLE: ConformsTo
  VALUE: IA-4

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: CLI-REG-002
TITLE: Demographic minimum
STATEMENT: Clinic shall require the identifiers the registration policy lists.
STATUS: Active
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  ROLE: Refines
  VALUE: ENT-CLI-001
- TYPE: Parent
  ROLE: ConformsTo
  VALUE: IA-4

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: CLI-REG-003
TITLE: Merge
STATEMENT: Clinic shall merge duplicate patients only under the health-information role, and shall audit the merge.
STATUS: Approved
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  ROLE: Refines
  VALUE: ENT-CLI-001
- TYPE: Parent
  ROLE: Refines
  VALUE: PLT-AUD-001
- TYPE: Parent
  ROLE: ConformsTo
  VALUE: AC-6
- TYPE: Parent
  ROLE: ConformsTo
  VALUE: AU-2
- TYPE: Parent
  ROLE: ConformsTo
  VALUE: V-222612

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: CLI-REG-004
TITLE: Proxy
STATEMENT: Clinic shall let an authorized proxy act for a patient and shall record the authority.
STATUS: Active
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  ROLE: Refines
  VALUE: ENT-CLI-001
- TYPE: Parent
  ROLE: ConformsTo
  VALUE: AC-2
- TYPE: Parent
  ROLE: ConformsTo
  VALUE: AC-3

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: CLI-REG-005
TITLE: Minor
STATEMENT: Clinic shall apply the minor-access rule before showing a chart to a guardian.
STATUS: Draft
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  ROLE: Refines
  VALUE: ENT-CLI-001
- TYPE: Parent
  ROLE: ConformsTo
  VALUE: AC-3
[[/SECTION]]

[[SECTION]]
UID: CLI-SEC-SCH
PREFIX: SCH
TITLE: Scheduling

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: CLI-SCH-001
TITLE: Book
STATEMENT: Clinic shall book an appointment only into an open slot for a clinician who treats that service.
STATUS: Active
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  ROLE: Refines
  VALUE: ENT-CLI-002
- TYPE: Parent
  ROLE: Refines
  VALUE: PLT-ID-003
- TYPE: Parent
  ROLE: ConformsTo
  VALUE: AC-3

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: CLI-SCH-002
TITLE: Change
STATEMENT: Clinic shall keep the prior slot when an appointment is moved.
STATUS: Active
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  ROLE: Refines
  VALUE: ENT-CLI-002
- TYPE: Parent
  ROLE: Refines
  VALUE: PLT-AUD-004
- TYPE: Parent
  ROLE: ConformsTo
  VALUE: AU-9

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: CLI-SCH-003
TITLE: Cancel reason
STATEMENT: Clinic shall record who cancelled an appointment and the reason.
STATUS: Active
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  ROLE: Refines
  VALUE: ENT-CLI-002
- TYPE: Parent
  ROLE: Refines
  VALUE: PLT-AUD-002
- TYPE: Parent
  ROLE: ConformsTo
  VALUE: AU-3

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: CLI-SCH-004
TITLE: Reminder
STATEMENT: Clinic shall send the appointment reminder through patient messaging and record delivery.
STATUS: Active
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  ROLE: Refines
  VALUE: ENT-COM-003
- TYPE: Parent
  ROLE: Refines
  VALUE: PLT-MON-008
- TYPE: Parent
  ROLE: ConformsTo
  VALUE: IR-6

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: CLI-SCH-005
TITLE: No-show
STATEMENT: Clinic shall mark a no-show and shall not delete the slot history.
STATUS: Active
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  ROLE: Refines
  VALUE: ENT-CLI-002
- TYPE: Parent
  ROLE: ConformsTo
  VALUE: AU-9

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: CLI-SCH-006
TITLE: Overbook
STATEMENT: Clinic shall allow an overbook only for the role named in the clinic policy.
STATUS: Draft
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  ROLE: Refines
  VALUE: ENT-CLI-002
- TYPE: Parent
  ROLE: Refines
  VALUE: PLT-ID-003
- TYPE: Parent
  ROLE: ConformsTo
  VALUE: AC-6
[[/SECTION]]

[[SECTION]]
