[REQUIREMENT]
UID: CLI-RX-002
TITLE: Prescription sign
STATEMENT: Clinic shall sign a prescription with the prescriber's authenticator, not a shared kiosk session.
STATUS: Active
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  ROLE: Refines
  VALUE: ENT-CLI-004
